WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.823
Week 16: Weather, Nature, and Plans. understand a forecast describe terrain change plans because of conditions

2
00:00:07.823 --> 00:00:30.268
Read for the situation. El pronóstico anuncia lluvia intensa y viento en la montaña. El grupo cambia la ruta, lleva más agua y evita una zona cerrada por riesgo de incendio. The forecast announces heavy rain and wind in the mountains. The group changes its route, carries more water, and avoids an area closed because of wildfire risk.

3
00:00:30.268 --> 00:00:39.030
Read again for evidence. Identify who acts, what changes, when it happens, and which words establish the relationship between events.

4
00:00:39.030 --> 00:00:46.704
Reading activities. Reading activity 37; Reading activity 38; Reading activity 39

5
00:00:46.704 --> 00:00:54.698
Retell. Without looking back, give the main idea, three supporting details, and one reasonable inference in Spanish.

6
00:00:54.698 --> 00:01:22.087
Model language. El pronóstico anuncia lluvia intensa. — The forecast announces heavy rain. También anuncia viento en la montaña. — It also announces wind in the mountains. El grupo cambia de ruta. — The group changes route. Lleva más agua por seguridad. — It carries more water for safety. Evita una zona con riesgo de incendio. — It avoids an area with fire risk.

7
00:01:22.087 --> 00:01:32.241
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
